{"id":"poslezavtra","lemma":"послезавтра","pos":"adv","rank":3070,"glosses":["day after tomorrow"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d7/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%B0%D0%B2%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%81%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%B0%D0%B2%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Послезавтра мой день рождения.","en":"The day after tomorrow is my birthday.","words":[null,{"g":"my"},null,null],"phrases":[[2,4,"birthday"]]},{"text":"Я и завтра работаю, и послезавтра.","en":"I'm working tomorrow and the day after.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"tomorrow"},{"g":"to work","l":"работать"},{"g":"and"},null]},{"text":"Ты послезавтра свободен?","en":"Do you have time the day after tomorrow?","words":[{"g":"you"},null,null]},{"text":"Давайте встретимся послезавтра.","en":"Let's meet the day after tomorrow.","words":[{"g":"to let"},{"g":"to meet","l":"встретиться"},null]},{"text":"Я увижу вас послезавтра.","en":"I'll see you the day after tomorrow.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to see","l":"увидеть"},{"g":"you","l":"вы"},null]}]}